Zero point energy                ...      0.07680555 Eh      48.20 kcal/mol
Thermal vibrational correction   ...      0.00360447 Eh       2.26 kcal/mol
Thermal rotational correction    ...      0.00141627 Eh       0.89 kcal/mol
